      "message": "compiler-specific pragmas should be inside ifdefs so that they are applied only for that compiler (to avoid warnings about unrecognized pragmas). I don\u0027t know if Clang also has the -Weffc++ switch, but if not, the ifdef should exclude Clang. i.e.:\n\n#if defined(__GNUC__) \u0026\u0026 !defined(__clang__)",
